# Catalyst Provider

Use the Catalyst provider to manage supported Zoho Catalyst application
infrastructure with Terraform. Configure your own OAuth credentials, data center
and environment before making API requests.

~> **Note:** This community provider is under development and is not yet
available from the public Terraform Registry. The examples below use the intended
provider address with a local development override. Project lifecycle and user
role assignment are experimental; File Store is deprecated.

